<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>net.blumia.pineapple.steam-recording-exporter</id>
  <name>Pineapple Steam Recording Exporter</name>
  <name xml:lang="zh-CN">菠萝Steam录制导出工具</name>
  
  <summary>Export Steam game recordings to MP4 videos</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="zh-CN">将Steam游戏录制内容导出为MP4视频</summary>
  
  <description>
    <p>
      Pineapple Steam Recording Exporter is a Qt6-based application that helps you automatically 
      identify and export Steam game recordings to MP4 video files. It provides a user-friendly 
      interface to browse, preview, and convert your Steam game clips without quality loss.
    </p>
    <p>Key features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Automatic detection of Steam game recordings</li>
      <li>Lossless export to MP4 format using FFmpeg</li>
      <li>Built-in video preview and playback</li>
      <li>Management of exported video library</li>
      <li>Support for multi-segment recordings</li>
      <li>Game name resolution from Steam metadata</li>
    </ul>
    
    <p xml:lang="zh-CN">
      菠萝Steam录制导出工具是一个基于Qt6的应用程序，可以帮助您自动识别和导出Steam游戏录制为MP4视频文件。
      它提供了一个用户友好的界面来浏览、预览和无损转换您的Steam游戏片段。
    </p>
    <p xml:lang="zh-CN">主要功能：</p>
    <ul xml:lang="zh-CN">
      <li>自动检测Steam游戏录制</li>
      <li>使用FFmpeg无损导出为MP4格式</li>
      <li>内置视频预览和播放功能</li>
      <li>导出视频库管理</li>
      <li>支持多段录制</li>
      <li>从Steam元数据解析游戏名称</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  
